          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "This dataset is a combination of data from two cohorts: COVPACH (patients admitted with COVID-19) and SPACE (patients with (suspected) infections at the emergency department). Both original datasets are not shared, due to ongoing data collection and analysis and because both original datasets include cases and variables not used in this study."
